    text: "Buying second-hand clothes has never been more {0} among young people.\nFor many, the main attraction is that the clothes are so {1}:\na coat that costs £200 new may sell online for £15, which seems almost {2}.\nOthers buy second-hand because they want to be {3} consumers.\nFashion is one of the most {4} industries in the world, and making\na single pair of jeans uses an {5} amount of water.\nCharity shops are also a great place to find {6} pieces that nobody\nelse owns, which is why they are popular with {7} young designers.\nNot everything is in perfect condition, though, so it is {8} to check items carefully.",
